WEBVTT

00:10:56.557 --> 00:11:00.311
and other countries
who have vested interests in the region

00:11:00.335 --> 00:11:01.891
as non-voting members.

00:11:01.915 --> 00:11:03.969
But the big idea

00:11:03.993 --> 00:11:07.556
is to get all stakeholders together
to work together.

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:12.124
To work together to monitor
the health of the glaciers;

00:11:12.148 --> 00:11:17.028
to work together to shape and implement
policies to protect our glaciers,

00:11:17.052 --> 00:11:18.803
and, by extension,

00:11:18.827 --> 00:11:23.951
to protect the billions of people
who depend on our glaciers.

00:11:25.602 --> 00:11:27.009
We have to work together,

00:11:28.783 --> 00:11:33.354
because thinking globally,
acting locally ...